    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Desktop Standing Card Plates&gt; is a small game for placing cards on the desktop. You can place some cute gadgets on the desktop or arrange a card tray on your desktop. You can control the size, border, position and transparency of these plates at will. After you meet the criteria you can customize the brand, you can put any image you want to put the brand on your desktop for entertainment</p>",
